"s.a86e940e":{"t":"Spends more time away than at home and meets helpful noble patrons, but in old age usually closes one's eyes far from one's native place.","h":"70a98ec6"},
"s.34d0cc2a":{"t":"Always meets noble patrons, is respected by many people, and everything goes smoothly.","h":"fb5f9049"},
"s.24cd2e83":{"t":"Is deferred to by many people and often frequents grand places. Having natural authority, even petty people submit at first sight.","h":"9280469f"},
"s.bb3efe90":{"t":"Being away from home brings no benefit; little luck and much misfortune; later dies far from home.","h":"2d94c492"},
"s.13bb22de":{"t":"Strong presence with a tendency to lead and stand at the head, but easily drawn into disputes and gossip.","h":"0b2c1eb3"},
"s.a90e8ee2":{"t":"Bright and clever, learns quickly and is easily liked.","h":"899da8fb"},
"s.b05b8ffa":{"t":"A deep person with much contemplation, prone to worry.","h":"898c5b80"},
"s.b9a0ba50":{"t":"Gentle and refined in nature, skilled in social interaction.","h":"a121a032"},
"s.940996dc":{"t":"Talented in debate and argument, but easily entangled in legal matters or disputes.","h":"8451bf64"},
"s.a2ab4fe7":{"t":"Often meets minor gossip and is easily misunderstood.","h":"e5ad9884"},
"s.e71d01a8":{"t":"Strongly critical in nature, likes to break away from convention.","h":"69dcc2df"},
"s.1b3a8e1f":{"t":"Kind-hearted, often helps others, easily meets noble patrons.","h":"e11350d2"},
"s.fe574344":{"t":"Forceful and resolute in nature, but prone to clashes.","h":"12903a68"},
"s.9ce53fd7":{"t":"Blessed with good fortune and kindness, living a life with few extremes.","h":"13eb84e4"},
"s.1e6112e6":{"t":"Good communication skills, easily becomes famous.","h":"62fe8813"},
"s.dbefb67e":{"t":"Frank and upright, but lacking flexibility.","h":"0ee1083a"},
"s.41b4050f":{"t":"Able to accumulate money; finances are stable.","h":"e297e208"},
"s.453940a0":{"t":"Strong willpower, diligent and enduring.","h":"7176a5be"},
"s.d153fde7":{"t":"Easily meets opportunities and good luck.","h":"066b53ae"},
"s.312ead97":{"t":"Money comes and goes frequently.","h":"0ee2c43c"},
"s.b0ee3423":{"t":"A leader's temperament, with authority.","h":"7c42bb1f"},
"s.2d3631f7":{"t":"Strong vitality, develops easily.","h":"bb370cff"},
"s.33795c6f":{"t":"Strong career; status comes easily.","h":"a63f31e8"},
"s.154f6788":{"t":"Momentum at its peak; great success is easily achieved.","h":"427d8c20"},
"s.8a4a7c98":{"t":"Energy wanes; life is steady and calm.","h":"88cece65"},
